Jarvis, Scott. 2007. Theoretical and methodological issues in the investigation of conceptual transfer. Vigo International Journal of Applied Linguistics 4: 43-71.

Mac Donald, Kirsti. 1983. Uttrykk for framtid i norsk. Norskrift 39: 74-87.

